KAMUI CoRR+plain
"Two plain loads of one location may see a newer and then an older value: weak accesses are not morally strong, so SC per location does not order them (K2): allowed."
{
x=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 1,gpu 0 ;
 sw x, 1        | lw r0, x       ;
                | lw r1, x       ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
